{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
<section class="section" id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow | default: 'Sound Familiar?' }}</div>
    <h2>{{ s.heading | default: "Thin Lips Aren't Your Fault" }}</h2>
    <p class="lead">{{ s.intro | default: "Most lip plumpers make you choose between a real result and comfortable lips. If any of these feel familiar — you're not the only one." }}</p>

    <div class="grid-3">
      {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          <div class="pcard" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <div class="ic">{{ block.settings.icon }}</div>
            <h3>{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ block.settings.text }}</p>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="pcard"><div class="ic">⏳</div><h3>Your lips look thinner every year</h3><p>Natural volume and definition fade over time. Lipstick settles into fine lines, the border of your lip softens, and nothing in your bag actually fixes it.</p></div>
        <div class="pcard"><div class="ic">💉</div><h3>You want fuller lips — but not filler</h3><p>Needles are expensive, they wear off, and the results can look stiff or uneven. You want more volume without booking an appointment or committing to a syringe.</p></div>
        <div class="pcard"><div class="ic">😖</div><h3>Every plumper you've tried let you down</h3><p>Some just burn with no payoff. Others are sticky, or the tingle fades in two minutes with nothing to show for it. There's never been a plumper that's actually comfortable to wear.</p></div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <p class="closer">{{ s.closer | default: 'This one gives you a real, visible plump — with a warm spicy tingle instead of a harsh sting, and hydration that stays long after the tingle is gone.' }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Problem",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Sound Familiar?" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Thin Lips Aren't Your Fault" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "intro", "label": "Intro", "default": "Most lip plumpers make you choose between a real result and comfortable lips. If any of these feel familiar — you're not the only one." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "closer", "label": "Closing line", "default": "This one gives you a real, visible plump — with a warm spicy tingle instead of a harsh sting, and hydration that stays long after the tingle is gone." }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "pain",
      "name": "Pain point",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "icon", "label": "Emoji / icon", "default": "⏳" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title", "default": "Pain point title" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "text", "label": "Text", "default": "Describe the frustration." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 3,
  "presets": [{ "name": "Problem" }]
}
{% endschema %}
